1
00:01:33,606 --> 00:01:38,561
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Jinchuriki's Tears</font>

2
00:01:55,444 --> 00:01:57,283
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's a Paper Bomb left here, too!</font>

3
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:02,078
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a type that explodes
the instant it's peeled off...</font>

4
00:02:02,707 --> 00:02:04,206
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll just have to detonate it.</font>

5
00:02:04,575 --> 00:02:05,334
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see.</font>

6
00:02:05,504 --> 00:02:07,273
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're detonating a Paper Bomb!</font>

7
00:02:07,303 --> 00:02:09,470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop working and take cover!</font>

8
00:02:17,722 --> 00:02:18,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's do this.</font>

9
00:02:23,456 --> 00:02:27,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now isn't the time to be discussing
candidates for a new Kazekage!</font>

10
00:02:27,253 --> 00:02:29,610
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if you think about
the worst-case scenario,</font>

11
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:32,577
<font color="#FFFFFF">isn't it important to seize
the initiative?</font>

12
00:02:32,807 --> 00:02:33,776
<font color="#FFFFFF">More importantly,</font>

13
00:02:33,806 --> 00:02:36,303
<font color="#FFFFFF">the plan to rescue Lord Kazekage
should be the priority!</font>

14
00:02:36,603 --> 00:02:39,201
<font color="#FFFFFF">Securing village safety
is what's important!</font>

15
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:42,767
<font color="#FFFFFF">We must not break up
our limited forces in conditions like this.</font>

16
00:02:42,967 --> 00:02:43,966
<font color="#FFFFFF">What did you say?</font>

17
00:02:47,532 --> 00:02:48,761
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, excuse me...</font>

18
00:02:51,358 --> 00:02:52,327
<font color="#FFFFFF">Reporting!</font>

19
00:02:52,727 --> 00:02:56,054
<font color="#FFFFFF">An enemy trap has been discovered
in the rubble blocking the entrance.</font>

20
00:02:56,084 --> 00:02:58,481
<font color="#FFFFFF">We are currently proceeding
with its detonation...</font>

21
00:02:58,751 --> 00:02:59,820
<font color="#FFFFFF">There have been no casualties.</font>

22
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,918
<font color="#FFFFFF">However, a portion
of the entrance collapsed</font>

23
00:03:01,948 --> 00:03:03,416
<font color="#FFFFFF">due to the effects of the explosion.</font>

24
00:03:03,446 --> 00:03:06,843
<font color="#FFFFFF">It seems it will take
an extra half day for repairs!</font>

25
00:03:07,972 --> 00:03:11,938
<font color="#FFFFFF">Got it. Arrange it so that those
who are available are dispatched</font>

26
00:03:11,968 --> 00:03:13,207
<font color="#FFFFFF">to the repair site immediately.</font>

27
00:03:13,266 --> 00:03:14,066
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, sir!</font>

28
00:03:30,449 --> 00:03:31,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey wait!</font>

29
00:03:32,517 --> 00:03:34,186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks to Gaara,</font>

30
00:03:34,216 --> 00:03:37,642
<font color="#FFFFFF">the Village Hidden in the Sand was
left almost completely undamaged...</font>

31
00:03:38,541 --> 00:03:43,806
<font color="#FFFFFF">But... we paid too great
a price for that...</font>

32
00:03:45,604 --> 00:03:46,773
<font color="#FFFFFF">Reporting!</font>

33
00:03:47,402 --> 00:03:50,629
<font color="#FFFFFF">All of the bodies of those guarding
the skies have been verified.</font>

34
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:53,596
<font color="#FFFFFF">There is probably little doubt
that the enemy infiltrated</font>

35
00:03:53,626 --> 00:03:54,965
<font color="#FFFFFF">the center of the village from the sky...</font>

36
00:03:54,995 --> 00:03:55,764
<font color="#FFFFFF">Excuse me!</font>

37
00:03:56,523 --> 00:03:57,392
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

38
00:03:57,662 --> 00:03:59,690
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have been contacted
by the tracking unit.</font>

39
00:03:59,860 --> 00:04:02,817
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro was discovered about
half a day out of the village.</font>

40
00:04:03,956 --> 00:04:05,814
<font color="#FFFFFF">He is unconscious and
in serious condition.</font>

41
00:04:09,380 --> 00:04:10,609
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro...</font>

42
00:04:11,878 --> 00:04:15,544
<font color="#FFFFFF">Some members of the tracking unit
have recovered Kankuro and his puppets.</font>

43
00:04:15,574 --> 00:04:17,442
<font color="#FFFFFF">They are on their way
back to the village.</font>

44
00:04:17,942 --> 00:04:19,700
<font color="#FFFFFF">What about the location
of Lord Kazekage?</font>

45
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:21,568
<font color="#FFFFFF">The remaining members of
the tracking unit are in pursuit.</font>

46
00:04:21,798 --> 00:04:23,336
<font color="#FFFFFF">There should be a report soon...</font>

47
00:04:33,226 --> 00:04:35,454
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're late, Sasori my man...</font>

48
00:04:36,823 --> 00:04:39,620
<font color="#FFFFFF">I thought you didn't like to
keep people waiting.</font>

49
00:04:40,219 --> 00:04:44,675
<font color="#FFFFFF">But... I had enough fun
to make up for that.</font>

50
00:04:45,774 --> 00:04:47,712
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's up with that?</font>

51
00:04:48,142 --> 00:04:50,669
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't get so touchy.</font>

52
00:04:51,069 --> 00:04:55,035
<font color="#FFFFFF">You secured your mission target,
the One-Tail, after all.</font>

53
00:04:56,104 --> 00:05:00,629
<font color="#FFFFFF">My mission comes next...
after taking care of this guy.</font>

54
00:05:01,059 --> 00:05:03,526
<font color="#FFFFFF">But the one you're after...</font>

55
00:05:03,896 --> 00:05:07,552
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah, I still don't know where he is...</font>

56
00:05:08,092 --> 00:05:11,588
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'd be easier if
he'd just come to me...</font>

57
00:05:12,487 --> 00:05:14,545
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah... That's right...</font>

58
00:05:17,642 --> 00:05:19,310
<font color="#FFFFFF">What kind of Jinchuriki
was he again?</font>

59
00:05:20,110 --> 00:05:23,576
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well, worst case scenario,
even if I can't find him...</font>

60
00:05:24,805 --> 00:05:30,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">nobody can complain
since we caught one of the Jinchuriki.</font>

61
00:05:37,562 --> 00:05:40,289
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara, we're coming...!</font>

62
00:05:40,659 --> 00:05:44,415
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto! I know you're in a hurry,
but don't disrupt the unit!</font>

63
00:05:44,915 --> 00:05:46,383
<font color="#FFFFFF">But, but...!</font>

64
00:05:46,513 --> 00:05:47,982
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't lose your cool...</font>

65
00:05:48,012 --> 00:05:50,209
<font color="#FFFFFF">Master Jiraiya told you not to,
remember?</font>

66
00:05:52,547 --> 00:05:53,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">For crying out loud...</font>

67
00:05:57,872 --> 00:05:58,871
<font color="#FFFFFF">Temari!</font>

68
00:06:06,863 --> 00:06:08,261
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hurry up and get him
to the operating room!</font>

69
00:06:09,290 --> 00:06:10,459
<font color="#FFFFFF">Operating Room</font>

70
00:06:15,624 --> 00:06:17,682
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is this... poison?</font>

71
00:06:18,321 --> 00:06:19,750
<font color="#FFFFFF">Prepare an antidote!</font>

72
00:06:21,948 --> 00:06:23,116
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

73
00:06:25,774 --> 00:06:26,973
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara...</font>

74
00:06:29,210 --> 00:06:31,168
<font color="#FFFFFF">What? Gaara was...?</font>

75
00:06:38,501 --> 00:06:40,359
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was having a bad feeling...</font>

76
00:06:43,426 --> 00:06:46,024
<font color="#FFFFFF">It'll take about two and a half days
to get to the Sand from here...</font>

77
00:06:46,223 --> 00:06:47,023
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's hurry.</font>

78
00:06:47,722 --> 00:06:48,491
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right.</font>

79
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,588
<font color="#FFFFFF">Treatment Room 3</font>

80
00:06:52,817 --> 00:06:55,044
<font color="#FFFFFF">The wounds weren't that serious...</font>

81
00:06:55,784 --> 00:06:56,813
<font color="#FFFFFF">The problem is...</font>

82
00:06:57,442 --> 00:06:59,440
<font color="#FFFFFF">The poison, huh...?</font>

83
00:06:59,940 --> 00:07:02,307
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes, it's a completely new poison.</font>

84
00:07:02,507 --> 00:07:05,005
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have absolutely no idea
how to neutralize it.</font>

85
00:07:05,904 --> 00:07:10,129
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara... and now Kankuro, too...</font>

86
00:07:28,711 --> 00:07:31,778
<font color="#FFFFFF">Taking Naruto is the top-priority duty</font>

87
00:07:31,808 --> 00:07:35,974
<font color="#FFFFFF">given to us by our organization,
the Akatsuki.</font>

88
00:07:37,142 --> 00:07:40,399
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not so much you
that they're after...</font>

89
00:07:41,198 --> 00:07:42,937
<font color="#FFFFFF">it's what's inside you they want.</font>

90
00:07:43,496 --> 00:07:47,092
<font color="#FFFFFF">But as long as you have
the Nine-Tails sealed within you...</font>

91
00:07:47,662 --> 00:07:52,986
<font color="#FFFFFF">they might want to have that power
under their own control...</font>

92
00:07:54,755 --> 00:07:58,751
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto! I told you earlier
not to disrupt the unit...</font>

93
00:07:58,781 --> 00:08:00,349
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like it!</font>

94
00:08:04,245 --> 00:08:08,511
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even I know why they're after
people like Gaara and me...</font>

95
00:08:10,009 --> 00:08:11,868
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know it already,
don't you, Sakura...?</font>

96
00:08:16,663 --> 00:08:17,932
<font color="#FFFFFF">That I've got...</font>

97
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:23,356
<font color="#FFFFFF">the Nine-Tailed Fox Spirit
sealed inside me...</font>

98
00:08:32,547 --> 00:08:34,715
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, it's that kid.</font>

99
00:08:34,745 --> 00:08:37,042
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eww, let's get out of here.</font>

100
00:08:47,902 --> 00:08:53,526
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gaara and I both...
have monsters inside us...</font>

101
00:08:54,595 --> 00:08:58,461
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what they're after!</font>

102
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,558
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what I don't like!</font>

103
00:09:01,987 --> 00:09:04,315
<font color="#FFFFFF">They only see us as monsters!</font>

104
00:09:04,615 --> 00:09:07,482
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't like their selfish way
of viewing us!</font>

105
00:09:10,908 --> 00:09:12,007
<font color="#FFFFFF">A monster, huh...?</font>

106
00:09:13,146 --> 00:09:15,304
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that's the case,
then we're the same...</font>

107
00:09:15,804 --> 00:09:18,471
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right. I was born a monster.</font>

108
00:09:20,599 --> 00:09:24,335
<font color="#FFFFFF">Everything about us...
was the same...</font>

109
00:09:25,834 --> 00:09:30,928
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he... fought all by himself
a lot more than me...</font>

110
00:09:33,356 --> 00:09:34,355
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

111
00:09:36,353 --> 00:09:40,449
<font color="#FFFFFF">To them, I'm now an artifact
of a past they want to erase.</font>

112
00:09:41,917 --> 00:09:46,013
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then why should I exist
and what should I live for?</font>

113
00:09:46,673 --> 00:09:49,510
<font color="#FFFFFF">I thought about it,
but couldn't find an answer...</font>

114
00:09:50,539 --> 00:09:54,665
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I need that reason while I'm alive...</font>

115
00:09:55,903 --> 00:09:58,601
<font color="#FFFFFF">If not, it's the same as dying...</font>

116
00:10:02,956 --> 00:10:04,825
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Akatsuki was after him!</font>

117
00:10:05,953 --> 00:10:07,792
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just like me this time, too...</font>

118
00:10:08,051 --> 00:10:10,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">And yet, why does he always
have to be</font>

119
00:10:10,719 --> 00:10:12,916
<font color="#FFFFFF">the one to get the short end
of the stick?</font>

120
00:10:14,085 --> 00:10:15,584
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's always him!</font>

121
00:10:16,443 --> 00:10:20,239
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why I can't be wasting
any time getting to him!</font>

122
00:10:20,809 --> 00:10:23,536
<font color="#FFFFFF">This time, I want to save him
right away!</font>

123
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:40,289
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto...</font>

124
00:10:41,558 --> 00:10:43,056
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uzumaki...</font>

125
00:10:51,678 --> 00:10:52,707
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thank you...</font>

126
00:11:20,379 --> 00:11:22,577
<font color="#FFFFFF">You say Kankuro's regained
consciousness?</font>

127
00:11:23,746 --> 00:11:27,841
<font color="#FFFFFF">He has, but he's just barely
able to respond to us...</font>

128
00:11:27,971 --> 00:11:30,039
<font color="#FFFFFF">His condition has worsened
since yesterday.</font>

129
00:11:37,102 --> 00:11:39,600
<font color="#FFFFFF">Baki... Is that you...?</font>

130
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,298
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kankuro!</font>

131
00:11:42,956 --> 00:11:44,455
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's... it's him...</font>

132
00:11:45,554 --> 00:11:46,792
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't raise your voice!</font>

133
00:11:46,822 --> 00:11:48,221
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not good for you
in your condition!</font>

134
00:11:50,589 --> 00:11:53,716
<font color="#FFFFFF">Th-Th Red Sand...</font>

135
00:12:01,678 --> 00:12:05,134
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see... So that explains it...</font>

136
00:12:05,773 --> 00:12:06,802
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lord Baki...?</font>

137
00:12:14,325 --> 00:12:15,264
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, Lord Baki.</font>

138
00:12:15,294 --> 00:12:18,591
<font color="#FFFFFF">Contact the tracking unit!
Tell them to turn back immediately!</font>

139
00:12:18,790 --> 00:12:21,887
<font color="#FFFFFF">Actually, we haven't heard
anything from them</font>

140
00:12:21,917 --> 00:12:23,656
<font color="#FFFFFF">since recovering Kankuro yesterday...</font>

141
00:12:24,655 --> 00:12:25,853
<font color="#FFFFFF">We were too late...</font>

142
00:12:28,051 --> 00:12:31,078
<font color="#FFFFFF">We have no choice
but to consult with them...</font>

143
00:12:32,047 --> 00:12:33,276
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh? What is it?</font>

144
00:12:33,546 --> 00:12:36,273
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nothing...
I'm... going out for a bit.</font>

145
00:12:36,702 --> 00:12:37,841
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh, but...!</font>

146
00:12:41,438 --> 00:12:44,794
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our superiors told us to give them
a progress report this morning...</font>

147
00:12:45,034 --> 00:12:48,161
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you think I have the time
to be leisurely giving reports?</font>

148
00:12:48,531 --> 00:12:50,858
<font color="#FFFFFF">Action takes precedence
over meetings right now!</font>

149
00:12:51,358 --> 00:12:52,627
<font color="#FFFFFF">Y-Yes, sir!</font>

150
00:12:53,626 --> 00:12:56,183
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is what happens
as soon as Gaara disappears...</font>

151
00:12:56,623 --> 00:12:57,622
<font color="#FFFFFF">Give me a break...</font>

152
00:13:02,846 --> 00:13:05,644
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have no choice but to consult
with the honorable siblings...</font>

153
00:13:06,643 --> 00:13:10,569
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I wonder...
will they come to our aid willingly?</font>

154
00:13:19,659 --> 00:13:23,526
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now, now, the food pills are
only for emergencies...</font>

155
00:13:23,925 --> 00:13:26,623
<font color="#FFFFFF">Girls of your age especially need
to be careful not to eat too...</font>

156
00:13:30,289 --> 00:13:31,188
<font color="#FFFFFF">She got mad...</font>

157
00:13:32,117 --> 00:13:35,384
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's totally sexual harassment...
old man.</font>

158
00:13:36,982 --> 00:13:37,941
<font color="#FFFFFF">Naruto.</font>

159
00:13:40,109 --> 00:13:42,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've met him before, haven't you?</font>

160
00:13:44,605 --> 00:13:45,973
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi Uchiha...</font>

161
00:13:47,731 --> 00:13:50,569
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he's after you.</font>

162
00:13:52,527 --> 00:13:56,363
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't just train over these past
two and a half years.</font>

163
00:13:56,822 --> 00:13:59,020
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got into Master Tsunade's library</font>

164
00:13:59,060 --> 00:14:01,318
<font color="#FFFFFF">and did outside investigations
the best I could.</font>

165
00:14:02,087 --> 00:14:06,952
<font color="#FFFFFF">And now... what was bothering me
finally makes sense now!</font>

166
00:14:07,911 --> 00:14:11,607
<font color="#FFFFFF">I wouldn't call it a dream,
but I've got an ambition!</font>

167
00:14:12,377 --> 00:14:18,600
<font color="#FFFFFF">To restore the clan and
to kill a certain man... no matter what!</font>

168
00:14:21,298 --> 00:14:24,764
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm the only one who can kill him.</font>

169
00:14:27,492 --> 00:14:29,190
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm an avenger.</font>

170
00:14:29,689 --> 00:14:32,187
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have to become stronger
than him...</font>

171
00:14:32,427 --> 00:14:35,653
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't have time to be getting
tripped up in a place like this.</font>

172
00:14:37,382 --> 00:14:39,719
<font color="#FFFFFF">The person Sasuke wants to kill...</font>

173
00:14:39,749 --> 00:14:42,776
<font color="#FFFFFF">is his own older brother
Itachi Uchiha, right...?</font>

174
00:14:43,615 --> 00:14:45,314
<font color="#FFFFFF">A member of the Akatsuki!</font>

175
00:14:49,170 --> 00:14:51,807
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi... Uchiha!</font>

176
00:14:53,036 --> 00:14:55,234
<font color="#FFFFFF">Itachi... Uchiha?</font>

177
00:14:57,302 --> 00:14:59,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to kill you!</font>

178
00:15:01,258 --> 00:15:02,996
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just as you told me to do,</font>

179
00:15:03,955 --> 00:15:08,021
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've resented you, hated you, and...</font>

180
00:15:08,351 --> 00:15:11,318
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've lived...</font>

181
00:15:13,246 --> 00:15:14,445
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've lived...</font>

182
00:15:15,883 --> 00:15:17,442
<font color="#FFFFFF">only to kill you!</font>

183
00:15:25,703 --> 00:15:27,631
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure enough, you're brothers...</font>

184
00:15:27,871 --> 00:15:31,498
<font color="#FFFFFF">I see power greater than Itachi's hidden
in those eyes of yours...</font>

185
00:15:33,625 --> 00:15:36,123
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sasuke will definitely seek me out...</font>

186
00:15:36,423 --> 00:15:38,590
<font color="#FFFFFF">in search of power...</font>

187
00:15:41,158 --> 00:15:46,353
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why Sasuke is with Orochimaru
in an attempt to obtain power...</font>

188
00:15:47,012 --> 00:15:50,409
<font color="#FFFFFF">But Orochimaru is
after Sasuke's body, right?</font>

189
00:15:50,978 --> 00:15:53,076
<font color="#FFFFFF">And we only have six months left!</font>

190
00:15:55,404 --> 00:15:57,272
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sakura knows about that too...</font>

191
00:15:57,841 --> 00:16:02,067
<font color="#FFFFFF">And Orochimaru used to be
a member of the Akatsuki.</font>

192
00:16:03,096 --> 00:16:06,193
<font color="#FFFFFF">Basically this is what I want... to say.</font>

193
00:16:07,761 --> 00:16:10,488
<font color="#FFFFFF">The closer we get to the Akatsuki,</font>

194
00:16:10,528 --> 00:16:12,726
<font color="#FFFFFF">the closer we get to information
about Orochimaru...</font>

195
00:16:16,922 --> 00:16:18,451
<font color="#FFFFFF">If that happens...</font>

196
00:16:19,779 --> 00:16:21,448
<font color="#FFFFFF">we'll eventually get closer to Sasuke!</font>

197
00:16:25,543 --> 00:16:28,411
<font color="#FFFFFF">And after that, Itachi Uchiha...</font>

198
00:16:29,170 --> 00:16:31,368
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our worst enemy who
plagued Sasuke for so long...</font>

199
00:16:31,408 --> 00:16:33,505
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the one who's after Naruto...</font>

200
00:16:35,533 --> 00:16:39,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">This time I'll save the two of them!</font>

201
00:17:24,185 --> 00:17:26,283
<font color="#FFFFFF">It appears someone's come...</font>

202
00:17:31,148 --> 00:17:32,876
<font color="#FFFFFF">Say, Big Sister...</font>

203
00:17:42,636 --> 00:17:45,863
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, Big Sister...!</font>

204
00:18:01,517 --> 00:18:02,746
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you dead?</font>

205
00:18:22,297 --> 00:18:26,093
<font color="#FFFFFF">Gotcha! I was playing dead.</font>

206
00:18:32,586 --> 00:18:36,612
<font color="#FFFFFF">Cut it out. That senility act's
too real, Big Sister...</font>

207
00:18:45,903 --> 00:18:47,002
<font color="#FFFFFF">Honored siblings...</font>

208
00:18:53,465 --> 00:18:56,892
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have come to request
your assistance.</font>

209
00:19:01,188 --> 00:19:04,185
<font color="#FFFFFF">Old books are supposed
to be tied in a bundle</font>

210
00:19:04,215 --> 00:19:06,382
<font color="#FFFFFF">and left up on a high shelf...</font>

211
00:19:07,252 --> 00:19:09,979
<font color="#FFFFFF">What can we possibly do now...?</font>

212
00:19:10,978 --> 00:19:13,775
<font color="#FFFFFF">An organization called the Akatsuki
has taken the Shukaku.</font>

213
00:19:13,805 --> 00:19:16,772
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we leave things as they stand now,
there will be great trouble.</font>

214
00:19:17,341 --> 00:19:22,336
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's your generation now.
You guys deal with it yourselves.</font>

215
00:19:22,666 --> 00:19:26,093
<font color="#FFFFFF">You two have powerful connections
with each land,</font>

216
00:19:26,133 --> 00:19:29,689
<font color="#FFFFFF">including villages in lands
we are not allied with...</font>

217
00:19:30,628 --> 00:19:34,284
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's only so much information
we can gather on our own...</font>

218
00:19:36,382 --> 00:19:39,080
<font color="#FFFFFF">We've long since been retired.</font>

219
00:19:39,379 --> 00:19:42,446
<font color="#FFFFFF">We no longer have
any attachments to the world.</font>

220
00:19:43,216 --> 00:19:48,041
<font color="#FFFFFF">Although I guess it'd be nice
to see my grandchild's face one more time...</font>

221
00:19:48,410 --> 00:19:49,769
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's very convenient.</font>

222
00:19:51,767 --> 00:19:55,603
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your grandson is a member
of the Akatsuki.</font>

223
00:20:03,625 --> 00:20:04,694
<font color="#FFFFFF">Granny Chiyo...</font>

224
00:21:37,161 --> 00:21:38,630
<font color="#FFFFFF">In this season of
cherry blossoms blooming...</font>

225
00:21:38,700 --> 00:21:39,799
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the biggest opportunity
of the year!</font>

226
00:21:39,829 --> 00:21:41,297
<font color="#FFFFFF">- We're doing it again this year...
- To win!</font>

227
00:21:41,327 --> 00:21:43,495
<font color="#FFFFFF">- The Leaf Jumbo Lottery!
- The Leaf Jumbo Lottery!</font>

228
00:21:43,595 --> 00:21:44,924
<font color="#FFFFFF">First prize is 20 million ryo!</font>

229
00:21:44,954 --> 00:21:47,421
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Buy it and you're rich, double chance!
- Those who don't, it's oh my god!</font>

230
00:21:47,451 --> 00:21:49,519
<font color="#FFFFFF">- If you're asked, "Take it or lose it"
- Take the ticket straight to paradise!</font>

231
00:21:49,549 --> 00:21:51,687
<font color="#FFFFFF">- The golden life you dreamed of...
- ... Is only 30 ryo per ticket!</font>

232
00:21:51,717 --> 00:21:54,414
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Why not bet for this chance of a life time?
- Let's bet for this chance of a life time!</font>

233
00:21:54,544 --> 00:21:56,712
<font color="#FFFFFF">- The Leaf Jumbo Lottery!
- The Leaf Jumbo Lottery!</font>

234
00:21:56,742 --> 00:21:58,340
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Tickets go on sale...
- ... Tomorrow morning at ten!</font>

235
00:21:58,380 --> 00:22:00,608
<font color="#FFFFFF">The lifestyle of the famous
can be yours!</font>

236
00:22:00,838 --> 00:22:02,306
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right! I'm sold!</font>

237
00:22:02,576 --> 00:22:05,673
<font color="#FFFFFF">Next time:
"Sealing Jutsu: Nine Phantom Dragons"</font>

